{
  "info": {
    "name": "Walatra - Midtrans Core Payments",
    "description": "Isi customer_token dan order_id dari checkout. Pilih payment_method: bca_va, bni_va, bri_va, mandiri_bill, permata_va, qris. Retry wajib memakai idempotency_key yang sama; ganti key hanya untuk metode baru atau percobaan kedaluwarsa. Respons 202 berarti status transaksi lama belum pasti; ulangi request ganti metode dengan metode dan Idempotency-Key yang sama, jangan membayar instruksi lama. Refresh hanya membaca status dan tidak membuat charge baru. Jika ada pembayaran terlambat, order masuk payment_review. QR berupa PNG. Webhook disiapkan di dashboard Midtrans, bukan dipanggil frontend. Server Key tidak diperlukan dan tidak boleh disimpan di koleksi ini. Order baru wajib dibuat dengan checkout_token dari preview. Alur cart dan checkout tersedia di koleksi Walatra - Cart dan Checkout. Pengaturan URL: base_url wajib mencakup /api/v1 tanpa slash terakhir, misalnya http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1. Jika Environment aktif memiliki variable dengan nama sama, nilainya menimpa Collection, termasuk ID/token yang diisi otomatis; samakan nilainya atau hapus duplikat Environment. Panduan pergantian metode: docs/postman/payment-method-switching.postman_collection.json. Panduan Postman: docs/api/postman-setup.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{customer_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "customer_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "order_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "payment_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "payment_method",
      "value": "bca_va",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "idempotency_key",
      "value": "payment-order-1-attempt-1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Metode pembayaran",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/payment-methods"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Buat / retry instruksi pembayaran",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{idempotency_key}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}/payment",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"method\": \"{{payment_method}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
              "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
              "  if (data && data.payment) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"payment_id\", String(data.payment.id));",
              "}",
              "pm.test(\"Payment response\", () => pm.expect([200, 201, 202]).to.include(pm.response.code));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Snapshot pembayaran",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}/payment"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Refresh status dari Midtrans",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}/payment/refresh"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
              "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
              "  if (data && data.payment) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"payment_id\", String(data.payment.id));",
              "}",
              "pm.test(\"Payment response\", () => pm.expect([200, 201, 202]).to.include(pm.response.code));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Unduh gambar QRIS (Bearer token)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}/payments/{{payment_id}}/qr-code"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Detail order",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Batalkan order dan transaksi pending",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}/cancel"
      }
    }
  ]
}
